== § 2. Абелевы группы



 S1 $a+b = b+a$ (commutativity) \
 S2 $a+b = b+a$ (associativity) \
 S3 $a+0 = a$ \
 S4 $a+(-a) = 0$  \

 M1 $a b = b a$ (commutativity) \
 M1 $(a*b)c = a(b*c)$ (associativity) \
 M1 $a*1 = a$ \
 M1 $a*a^-1 = 1$ \


*DEF 1* An (additive) Abelian group is
a set A with an addition operation having the following
properties: S1 - S4 $quad forall ,a,b,c in A$

*DEF 1'* A (multiplicative) Abelian group
is a set A with a multiplication operation having
the following properties: M1 - M4 $quad forall ,a,b,c in A$


